<h1 data-copy-en="Lillian" data-copy-zh="Lillian">Lillian</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="Crystal services, alignment requirements and Soul Stone bonding." data-copy-zh="水晶服务、阵营条件与灵魂石羁绊。">Crystal services, alignment requirements and Soul Stone bonding.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 9 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section wiki-reading-section"><div class="container wiki-reading-layout">
<aside class="wiki-toc"><div class="wiki-toc-inner"><button aria-expanded="false" class="wiki-toc-toggle" data-wiki-toc-toggle="" type="button"><span data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><p class="wiki-toc-heading" data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</p><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="en" data-wiki-toc-links=""><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-overview">Overview</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-location">Where to find them</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-route">Route and relationship milestones</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-activities">Activities and rewards</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-troubleshooting">What usually blocks the next step</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-related">Related guides</a></div><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="zh" data-wiki-toc-links="" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-overview">概览</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-location">去哪里找</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-route">路线与关系进展</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-activities">行动与奖励</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-troubleshooting">卡住时检查什么</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-related">相关指南</a></div></div></aside>
<article class="wiki-article"><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><section id="en-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Other_Encounters_and_Shared_Rewards"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Proficiency_Upgrade"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Hell_Fire"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Soul_Stone_Recognition_and_Bonding"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="The_Eternal_War_and_Alignment"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Daily_Affection_and_Demonic_Allure"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Overview"></span><h2>Overview</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: Lillian — character portrait." href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/lillian.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Lillian — character portrait." decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/lillian.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Lillian — character portrait.</figcaption></figure><p>Lillian offers crystal services and a compact personal route. The services are usable as soon as you reach her lair; affection is for her conversations, stone bonding and later personal event.</p></section>
<section id="en-location"><h2>Where to find them</h2><p>From Back Alleys, take the Secret Lair entrance to Lillian's Lair. The entrance costs 0 minutes, and her portrait is available all day.</p></section>
<section id="en-route"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Finding_Lillian_and_Starting_the_Route"></span><h2>Route and relationship milestones</h2><p>The Eternal War begins at Friend (100). Its alignment choice is yours and does not gate the earlier crystal services. The stone-recognition scenes only need the corresponding stone in your inventory.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Automatic scene</th><th scope="col">Location / start window</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">The Eternal War</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Lillian's Lair</td><td data-label="Requirements">Friend (100)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Brute Stone Awakens</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Lillian's Lair</td><td data-label="Requirements">own Brute Stone</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Elemental Stone Awakens</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Lillian's Lair</td><td data-label="Requirements">own Elemental Stone</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Twilight Stone Awakens</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Lillian's Lair</td><td data-label="Requirements">own Twilight Stone</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Hell Fire</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Lillian's Lair</td><td data-label="Requirements">In Love (3000); Evil tier Nefarious (9th tier) or higher</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Lillian's Culinary Temptations</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Kitchen</td><td data-label="Requirements"></td></tr></tbody></table><p>Hell Fire needs In Love (3,000) and the Evil tier Nefarious, the ninth tier, or higher. With an owned Twilight Stone and In Love, bonding takes 60 minutes, once per day, for one stone level.</p><p>The optional Lillian's Culinary Temptations begins in Kitchen. Hunting Season Is Not Yet Open is a brief visit event, not an additional hunting activity.</p></section>
<section id="en-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Crystal_Services_at_the_Lair"></span><h2>Activities and rewards</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Requirements / start window</th><th scope="col">Cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Reward / limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Talk to Lillian</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Stranger (0)</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">20 min</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+1 base affection; 5/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Demonic Allure</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Known (25); Communication 75</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">30 min</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+8 direct affection; Attractiveness +1; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Proficiency Upgrade</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Stranger (0)</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">0 min; 10 Crystals</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">one-time proficiency/home upgrade</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Crystal services are location actions, separate from her portrait, and take 0 minutes. Extend Timeline spends 1 Crystal for 10 days while the countdown is active; Crystal Enlightenment spends 1 for a random eligible unknown skill; Learn Dark Magic spends 3 to learn Dark Magic once.</p><p>Resource Boost spends 1 Crystal for 50 common, 20 rare and 3 epic resources in each category: materials, fabrics and ingredients. Infernal Vitality Boost spends 1 for permanent +10 maximum Energy and can be repeated. Redeem Crystal Code opens the code-entry screen.</p><p>Proficiency Upgrade costs 10 Crystals for a one-time proficiency and bedroom upgrade. Check its own access prompt; no affection threshold is listed.</p><p>Her favorite stats are Ability, Charm, Rogue. The learned Deception skill improves her relationship bonus.</p><p>Start times are shown; the ending hour is excluded. Base affection receives the relationship bonuses, while direct affection is added as listed. Ordinary affection, player Erotic Experience and NPC intimacy experience are separate.</p></section>
<section id="en-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Troubleshooting"></span><h2>What usually blocks the next step</h2><ul><li>Close her portrait and inspect the location actions for crystal services.</li><li>Recognition needs the actual stone; recognition does not switch on its passive effect.</li><li>Demonic Allure needs Known (25) and Communication 75 and now includes Attractiveness +1, once.</li><li>For Hell Fire check both affection and alignment tier; for bonding check stone ownership and today’s use.</li></ul></section>
<section id="en-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Related_Pages"></span><h2>Related guides</h2><ul><li><a href="game-systems-crystals-and-doomsday.html">Crystals and the countdown</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-soul-stones.html">Soul Stones</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-alignment-system.html">Alignment tiers</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-relationships-dating-and-intimacy.html">Relationship bonuses</a></li></ul></section>
</div><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-zh" data-lang-panel="zh" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><section id="zh-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Other_Encounters_and_Shared_Rewards"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Proficiency_Upgrade"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Hell_Fire"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Soul_Stone_Recognition_and_Bonding"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-The_Eternal_War_and_Alignment"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Daily_Affection_and_Demonic_Allure"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Overview"></span><h2>概览</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：Lillian 的角色头像。" href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/lillian.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Lillian 的角色头像。" decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/lillian.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Lillian 的角色头像。</figcaption></figure><p>Lillian提供水晶服务，也有独立的关系事件。抵达巢穴后即可使用地点服务；好感主要影响对话、灵魂石羁绊与后续个人事件。</p></section>
<section id="zh-location"><h2>去哪里找</h2><p>从后巷的秘密巢穴入口进入Lillian的巢穴，不消耗时间。她的头像全天出现。</p></section>
<section id="zh-route"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Finding_Lillian_and_Starting_the_Route"></span><h2>路线与关系进展</h2><p>永恒之战要求朋友（100），其中的阵营选择由你决定，不是前期水晶服务的前置条件。灵魂石认可事件只要求持有对应石头。</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">自动事件</th><th scope="col">地点／开始时段</th><th scope="col">条件</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">永恒之战</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">Lillian的巢穴</td><td data-label="条件">朋友（100）</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">蛮力之石觉醒</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">Lillian的巢穴</td><td data-label="条件">持有蛮力之石</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">元素之石觉醒</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">Lillian的巢穴</td><td data-label="条件">持有元素之石</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">暮光之石觉醒</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">Lillian的巢穴</td><td data-label="条件">持有暮光之石</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">地狱之火</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">Lillian的巢穴</td><td data-label="条件">恋爱中（3000）；邪恶阵营第9阶“邪恶”或以上</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Lillian的烹饪诱惑</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">厨房</td><td data-label="条件"></td></tr></tbody></table><p>地狱之火同时要求恋爱中（3,000）及邪恶阵营第9阶“邪恶”或以上。持有暮光之石并达到恋爱中后，可每天花60分钟建立一次羁绊，使石头提升1级。</p><p>可选事件Lillian的烹饪诱惑在厨房开始。狩猎季尚未开放是一段简短到访事件，不会开启额外狩猎活动。</p></section>
<section id="zh-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Crystal_Services_at_the_Lair"></span><h2>行动与奖励</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">行动</th><th scope="col">条件／开始时段</th><th scope="col">消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">奖励／次数</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">和 Lillian 交谈</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">陌生人（0）</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">20分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">基础好感+1；每天5次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">恶魔魅力</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">已知（25）；沟通75</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">30分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">直接好感+8；吸引力+1；仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">熟练度升级</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">陌生人（0）</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">0分钟；水晶×10</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">一次性熟练度与卧室升级</td></tr></tbody></table><p>水晶服务位于地点行动中，与头像菜单分开，均不消耗时间。倒计时仍在进行时，延长时间线消耗1水晶延长10天；水晶启迪消耗1水晶，随机学习一项符合条件的未学技能；学习黑暗魔法消耗3水晶，学习一次黑暗魔法。</p><p>资源增幅消耗1水晶，分别获得材料、布料、食材各50普通、20稀有、3史诗。地狱活力增强每次消耗1水晶，永久增加10点精力上限，可重复使用。兑换水晶码打开兑换码输入界面。</p><p>熟练度升级消耗10水晶，一次性提升熟练度并升级卧室，没有好感门槛；先查看它自己的权限提示。</p><p>她偏好的属性为能力、魅力、盗贼。学会欺骗可提高关系加成。</p><p>表中均为开始时间，不包含结束整点。基础好感受关系加成影响，直接好感按所列数值增加。普通好感、玩家情趣经验和NPC亲密经验分别计算。</p></section>
<section id="zh-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Troubleshooting"></span><h2>卡住时检查什么</h2><ul><li>找不到水晶服务时，先关闭头像菜单，再查看地点行动。</li><li>认可事件需持有实际的灵魂石；认可不是被动效果生效的条件。</li><li>恶魔魅力要求已知（25）和沟通75，目前会给予吸引力+1，仅一次。</li><li>地狱之火需同时检查好感与阵营阶级；羁绊则需持有石头且当天尚未使用。</li></ul></section>
<section id="zh-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Related_Pages"></span><h2>相关指南</h2><ul><li><a href="game-systems-crystals-and-doomsday.html">水晶与倒计时</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-soul-stones.html">灵魂石</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-alignment-system.html">阵营阶级</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-relationships-dating-and-intimacy.html">关系加成</a></li></ul></section>
